ve); <bdbheb>כּוֺכְבֵי נִשְׁפּוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 3:9\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(18,3,9)\">Job 3:9</ref> <highlight>the stars of its twilight</highlight> (i.e. of night of Job's birth). — so <bdbheb>וְעַדהָֿעֶרֶב</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מֵהַנּ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>לְמָחֳרָתָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 30\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"200\" onclick=\"bcv(9,30,1)\">1Sam 30</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Klo')\">Klo</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kit')\">Kit</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('HPS')\">HPS</lookup> (read <bdbheb>לְהַחֲרִמָם</bdbheb> for <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לְמָח</bdbheb>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kit')\">Kit</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bu')\">Bu</lookup>); <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('The')\">Th</lookup>, after <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Lu')\">Luth</lookup>, below so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Buhl')\">Buhl<sup>Kex</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('SS')\">SS</lookup>; Löhr allows either. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>morning twilight</highlight> <ref ref=\"Job 7:4\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(18,7,4)\">Job 7:4</ref> (opposed to <bdbheb>עֶרֶב</bdbheb>). apparently also <ref ref=\"Ps 119:147\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"147\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"147\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,147)\">Ps 119:147</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Gen 3:8", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 3, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "1Sam 30:17", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 30, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Jer 13:16", "book": "JER", "chapter": 13, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Isa 21:4", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 21, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Job 3:9", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 3, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "2Kgs 7:5", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 7, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "2Kgs 7:7", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 7, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "2Kgs 7:12", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 7, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Isa 5:11"